cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived software release and the relevant experimental and molecular-theory references."
title: "NaCs Gate Control: Spectroscopy and Complete-Operation Error Benchmarks"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Gacesa"
    given-names: "Marko"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: 2026-11-05
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mgacesa66/nacs-gate-control"
abstract: >-
  Research software for assessing spectroscopically informed reduced
  models of a NaCs molecular quantum gate. Includes molecular
  spectroscopy and effective optical calibration, complete-gate
  propagation, parameter sensitivity with microwave recalibration,
  screened-basis convergence, matched control-objective comparisons,
  numerical benchmarks, and manuscript figure-generation scripts.
